 "subtitles": [
  {
   "start": 0.8,
   "end": 9.8,
   "text": "Aizawl grew up along the *ridges*. Every house, road and market climbs the hill"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.3,
   "end": 14.5,
   "text": "*Old Aizawl*: about 3 lakh people on steep ridges, with one road in and out"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.52,
   "end": 23.35,
   "text": "Below it, the *Tlawng valley* already has the railhead at *Sairang* and *Lengpui* airport"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.98,
   "end": 34.35,
   "text": "*Scenario*: a planned capital, *New Aizawl*, rises in the valley between them"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.52,
   "end": 44.85,
   "text": "The *Assembly and Secretariat*, 21,000 new homes and a 22 MW *compute park*"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.25,
   "end": 55.85,
   "text": "A *rapid transit line* joins Old and New Aizawl: about 19 km, 19 minutes"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.25,
   "end": 67.35,
   "text": "*Old Aizawl* keeps the heritage. *New Aizawl* carries the future"
  },
  {
   "start": 68.1,
   "end": 79.3,
   "text": "*New Aizawl*: wide boulevards, glass towers and a new *Capitol*"
  },
  {
   "start": 80.1,
   "end": 89.3,
   "text": "*Old Aizawl* and *New Aizawl*: one capital for Mizoram"
  }
